+# Returns the proc name suffix for a hierarchical method or typemethod.
+# The tokens are joined by underscores; underscores and percent signs
+# within the tokens are escaped so that distinct method names always
+# give distinct proc names, e.g. {a_b c} and {a b_c}.
+#
